sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (any of 8 languages)
    participant RT as Realtime service
    participant P as Pipeline (FastAPI)
    participant S as Safety ladder
    participant M as Memory (Vector Search)
    participant AE as Astrology/Numerology tools
    participant C as Claude (via abstraction layer)
    participant V as Voice (TTS router)
    U->>RT: text / streamed speech
    RT->>P: transcript + locale
    P->>P: language + script detection
    P->>S: safety pre-check (L1 classifier)
    S-->>P: clear (or constrain L2–L5, astrology framing removed)
    P->>P: intent routing (structured output)
    P->>P: required-data check → confidence state
    par retrieve in parallel
        P->>M: top-k memories (visibility-gated)
        M-->>P: consented context
        P->>AE: fact tool-calls (charts, panchang, numerology)
        AE-->>P: validated typed facts
    end
    P->>P: fact validation (schema, ranges, disputed?)
    P->>C: persona + locale style guide + facts + memories (prompt-cached)
    C-->>P: response draft + avatar state tag
    P->>P: grounding check (every claim cites fact-ID)
    P->>P: language-quality check (locale, script, register, glossary)
    P->>S: safety post-check (fear-selling lint)
    P->>V: TTS render (streamed, tone preset)
    V-->>RT: audio chunks + timestamps/visemes
    RT-->>U: text + voice + avatar state events
    P->>P: transcript store + memory-chip suggestion (consent chip)
